Ha L. Nguyen achieved his Ph.D. degree in 2017 at the University of Technology, Vietnam National University—Hochiminh, Vietnam. He then moved to King Fahd University of Petroleum and Minerals in Saudi Arabia and served as a research consultant. Dr. Nguyen has recently been working in the group of Prof. Omar Yaghi at the University of California Berkeley as a postdoctoral researcher. For the past years, Dr. Nguyen has focused his research on the structural design of MOFs and COFs to especially highlight their applicability in nanoscience and energy.
